WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.865
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.865 --> 00:00:03.240
SPEAKER: When you're ready to
start solving on the cloud,

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.400
the Google Cloud free program
is a great place to start.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.710
So what does that
actually include?

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.240
Once you create
your new account,

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.930
you'll have $300 in credits
for the first 90 days

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.000
to use across all
of Google Cloud.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.990
And don't worry.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.490
Even once you've
used your credits

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.500
or finished your
90 days, you won't

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.320
be charged unless you
manually upgrade your account.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.600
Once you upgrade, you'll
keep your Cloud resources

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.030
and any remaining credits.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:29.730
Plus, with the free tier,
new and existing users

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.040
can take advantage of many
of Google Cloud services

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.450
entirely for free.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.640
These services can be used
within a monthly limit,

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.380
letting you build and
test new solutions

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.270
on innovative
technology, including

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.370
running virtual machines,
serverless container

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:44.790
hosting, or data analysis
entirely for free.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.290
Each service has
different limits,

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.990
so try them out without
worrying about costs.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:52.230
On top of all that, you'll also
get $200 in monthly credits

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.990
towards usage of Google
Maps Platform products.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:57.060
Get started with
Google Cloud for free.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.510
[MUSIC PLAYING]

